---
title: Shopify Webhook Delivery Flow
---
flowchart LR
    Shopify([Shopify]) -->|POST /webhooks/{topic}| Receiver

    subgraph Receiver["Webhook Receiver (FastAPI)"]
        R1[Verify HMAC] --> R2{Valid?}
        R2 -->|No| R3[Return 401]
        R2 -->|Yes| R4[Idempotency Check]
        R4 --> R5{Already\nprocessed?}
        R5 -->|Yes| R6[Return 200 — skip]
        R5 -->|No| R7[Persist Event\nto Event Store]
        R7 --> R8[Enqueue Job\nto Queue]
        R8 --> R9[Return 200]
    end

    R7 --> EventStore[(Event Store\nPostgreSQL)]
    R8 --> Queue[(Message Queue\nRedis Streams)]

    Queue -->|async| Worker

    subgraph Worker["Worker Pool"]
        W1[Dequeue Job] --> W2[Process Event]
        W2 --> W3{Success?}
        W3 -->|Yes| W4[Mark Complete]
        W3 -->|No| W5{Retries\nLeft?}
        W5 -->|Yes| W6[Backoff & Retry]
        W6 --> W2
        W5 -->|No| W7[Move to DLQ]
    end

    W2 --> Target[Target System\nERP / WMS / CRM / Marketplace]
    W7 --> DLQ[(Dead Letter Queue\nPostgreSQL)]
    DLQ --> Replay[Replay Endpoint\nadmin-only]
    Replay -->|re-enqueue| Queue
